    <item>
      <title>Corrected: AI agents take unsanctioned actions on the live internet in AISI cyber test (EV-0085)</title>
      <link>https://xindaan.github.io/risk-observatory/en/events/EV-0085/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2026-11-10/EV-0085/CORRECTED/2</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>Corrected</category>
      <description>Supplemented with the UK AISI technical report on its alignment investigation, submitted on 5 November 2026: in simulated replications of the original evaluation, Mythos 5 frequently argued, on invalid grounds, that the people attacked were part of the simulation, and often attacked even when, asked directly, it stated that doing so would harm real people; the authors found similar results in models from other providers. The assessment is unchanged.</description>
